 screen after her  break-in thought 3. this time however  natalie portman has a special role after  director taika waititi gave her the  mighty hammer mjolnir at comic con 2019  it is certain that she won't be only the  shy scientist any longer but that she  will become mighty thor the two are  supported not only by the complete  guardians of the galaxy but also by the  new leader of asgard the valkyrie who  has been in the mcu since ragnarok she  is again played by tessa thompson also  jaime alexander as lady siff shotgun as  craiglin and of course whitehead himself  as the whimsical cork are back in the  game  it is also certain that there will be a  few cameo appearances like they have  been in thor ragnarok any fans were  astonished when in a small plane asgard  suddenly met daemon as loki sam nilas  odin and chris brother luke hemsworth  appeared as thor they are getting  supported by melissa mccarthy who has  been hired to play the evil sister hera  in love and thunder we are already  looking forward to this scene also  confirmed is russell crowe as zeus but  whether this role is to be taken  seriously or if it's just an easter egg  for the fans is unfortunately not known  yet  it's been quite a long time since we got  a scene in a superhero movie but now  it's finally time again christian bale  has been confirmed as the villain in  thor 4. if he can be half as convincing  as he was in the batman the dark knight  series we can definitely look forward to  some great acting he will embody gore  the godbutcher we will have a close look  at the whole story of gore in more  detail at a later point because he has  connections to many characters in the  mcu which we have already met it's  exciting to note here that after the  dark knight rises bale has actually  never wanted to take part in a comic  book adaption again he thinks the genre  is too boring and he always describes  wearing the costume as well let's call  it constricting however taiko was hitti  persuaded him with his charm and above  all a very good script to reconsider his  decision  the ancient gods of our earth will also  play a role two of them are already  confirmed the before mentioned zeus  played by russell crowe and the goddess  bastard played by akosia sabbat while  zeus in the comic stands in connection  to odin and asgard bastard is a goddess  of ancient egypt and is set in wakanda  so gore seems to be targeting not only  gods that we already know maybe thanks  to bastet there will be a bridge to  wakanda forever which will be released  in november this year  it is not yet known whether tom  hiddleston will play a part as loki  again what is certain is that the loki  of the original timeline is dead however  as we know another one was able to  escape with a tesseract and even got his  own series on disney plus we would  definitely be happy to see the two  brothers unite even if the loki from the  other timeline has not yet been as  purified as his dead other self  the mighty thorline will play an  important and big role in the upcoming  movie in it jane foster falls ill with  breast cancer and because of her deeds  pronounced worthy of carrying the hammer  mjolnir it is suspected that she get  cancer due to her contact with the  aether the more she uses her newly  acquired powers the worse the tumors  inside her become white hitti thinks  that this approach of the comics is very  interesting but he has not yet confirmed  that he will use it in the movie how  does she obtain the hammer the mjolnir  which we saw in handgame was finally  brought back into his line by captain  america one theory is that we're not  dealing with the jane foster of the old  movies but that she comes from another  timeline this would fit very well into  the new multiverse after all we already  got to see several versions of the  superheroes in spider-man away home and  in the trailer for doctor strange and  the multiverse of madness  another important role in the movie is  supposed to be the love stories of  course the first thing that comes to  mind is the romance between thor and  jane but there are more and more voices  that say the wild valkyrie embodied by  tessa thompson finally finds her love  even if her sexuality has not yet been  exactly illuminated so far we do know  that she's one of the lgbtq plus  characters in the mcu so it's possible  that there could be a romance with the  new jane or with lady sif  now to the villain gore the god butcher  he was only introduced in the comics in  2013 and is since then one of the most  dangerous opponents of thor gorill lived  on a very religious planet when his  parents died in an accident he renounces  the gods and goes into exile when he  then learns that such beings actually  exist but that they did not help to  protect his family he swears bloody  revenge he wants to perpetrate his  revenge with his powerful sword all  black this was created a long time ago  by the evil god null with it he beheaded  one already known to as celestial the  one from whose head nowhere was born  then with the power of the sword and of  the celestial he created the symbiotes  we know from venom noah was stranded on  the planet of gore when he learned that  he was a god he killed him with his own  sword and set off on his journey it is  conceivable that he hunts the ancient  gods of the earth and that they then  turn to asgard in need of help odin no  longer rules there but his air still  exists by the way a connection between  gore and mighty thor does not exist in  the comics why titty can therefore give  free reign to his creativity  as often mentioned before taika waititi  is again screenwriter director and actor  in one like this he also achieved great  success in the last part thor ragnarok  and made it the most successful movie in  the series to date after the current  production had to be postponed again and  again due to the ongoing situation  filming started on january 26 2021 in  the fox studios in australia in sydney  under the working title the big salad  particularly exciting is the camera  technology with which the new movie was  shot in this stagecraft technology is  used which was already used in the  disney series the mandalorian instead of  standing in front of a green screen the  actors are standing in front of led  video walls where the environment is  displayed on one of the advantages of  this is that the actors can actually see  their surroundings unlike with a green  screen and can thus better empathize  with their role taika white hitti and  chris hemsworth also allowed themselves  a little joke and posted the so-called  first official poster of the movie which  shows well only them on social media  hemsworth wrote about it saying that  they had to really tightly calculate the  budget for the thor love and thunder  poster but that the message is clear  lots of love and lots of thunder  at the end of the video we have some fun  facts for you about the production for  example thor with his fourth solo movie  is now the only mcu character which can  show off so many standalone movies  the cast includes five oscar winners  christian bale matt damon natalie  portman taika whitehead and russell  crowe with balon crow they have already  three actors after michael keaton  switched from dc to marvel it will be  the 29th movie of the marvel cinematic  universe chris hemsworth who is already  playing the role of thor for the 8th  time achieved with 105 kilograms his  largest physique to date for this movie  just to maintain the achieved mass he  had to eat eight times a day  so enough from us now it's time for your  opinion how hyped are you for the new  thor movie we can hardly wait for the  first trailer which you will of course  see here on our channel as soon as it is  released after all ytd said that it will  probably be the best mcu movie ever are  you still missing someone in the current  cast that you would like to see and what  do you think about the plot write us in  the comments and if you liked our video  please don't forget to give it a thumbs  up see you next time  [Music]  you

